=============================================================================
fideslang default taxonomy
=============================================================================

This product includes the data categories, data uses and data subjects of the
fideslang default taxonomy, version 3.1.4: their keys, hierarchy, names,
descriptions, version_added values and deprecations. They are in the files

  src/main/resources/io/github/devbpm/linneo/internal/fideslang-data-categories.tsv
  src/main/resources/io/github/devbpm/linneo/internal/fideslang-data-uses.tsv
  src/main/resources/io/github/devbpm/linneo/internal/fideslang-data-subjects.tsv

and in the constants and their documentation in the classes
io.github.devbpm.linneo.Categories, DataUses and DataSubjects.

  Work:      fideslang (Fides language) default taxonomy, version 3.1.4
  Creator:   Ethyca, Inc.
  Source:    https://github.com/ethyca/fideslang
             https://pypi.org/project/fideslang/3.1.4/
  Licence:   Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
             https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
             The fideslang package metadata also declares the Apache License,
             Version 2.0; this product complies with both.

The fideslang material is provided by its licensor "as is" and "as available",
without representations or warranties of any kind; see section 5 of the
CC BY 4.0 licence.

Changes made by Linneo to the fideslang material:
  - converted from the Python modules src/fideslang/default_taxonomy/data_*.py
    to tab-separated values (tools/fideslang/update.py);
  - normalised whitespace in descriptions;
  - written an empty version_added as 2.0.0, the value fideslang's
    default_factory assigns.
No key, parent, name or description was altered.

Linneo adds, in separate files, material that is not part of fideslang and is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
  - its own terms (linneo-data-categories.tsv, linneo-data-uses.tsv,
    linneo-data-subjects.tsv), each recorded with origin "linneo";
  - a protection policy for the data categories (linneo-category-policy.tsv):
    legal nature, confidentiality, integrity and secrecy. fideslang assigns no
    such levels; they are Linneo's.

