Microsoft Common Data Model
=============================================================================

The values of io.github.devbpm.linneo.Identifiability and the names of some of
Linneo's education terms are inspired by the Microsoft Common Data Model
(https://github.com/microsoft/CDM, CC BY 4.0). No Common Data Model material is
reproduced.
